### BouyUp chain API — run from GoLand / IntelliJ HTTP client (or VS Code REST Client).
### Start the service with: go run ./cmd/sgchain serve -config configs/mock.json
### Amounts are in the currency's smallest unit: VND in đồng, CNY in fen (1 CNY = 100).
@base = http://localhost:12080

### overview for the team: what this does, security design, every secret (demo keys), how to decrypt
GET {{base}}/v1/overview?format=markdown

### chain, contracts and node status
GET {{base}}/v1/chain

### ------------------------------------------------------------ banks & regions

### regions (VN, CN) and their provinces
GET {{base}}/v1/regions

### banks of a region
GET {{base}}/v1/banks?region=VN

### full bank profile: limits, policy, contract
GET {{base}}/v1/banks/VCB

### the policy Agent 3 reads
GET {{base}}/v1/banks/AGRI/policy

### the bank's contract with BouyUp
GET {{base}}/v1/banks/WEBANK/contract

### ------------------------------------------------------------ withdrawals

### Agent 4 withdrawal, Vietnam, 3 banks (requestId makes retries safe)
POST {{base}}/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "agent4-req-0001",
  "userId": "U-778899",
  "accountNo": "0071000123456",
  "amount": 500000000,
  "region": "VN",
  "province": "VN-HN",
  "bankSplit": { "VCB": 60, "BIDV": 25.5, "TCB": 14.5 },
  "actor": { "type": "agent", "agentId": "agent-4", "name": "Disbursement & Collection", "version": "4.2.0", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "runId": "run-20261010-8812" }
}

### manual withdrawal by a human, China, 2 banks
POST {{base}}/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "U-102938",
  "accountNo": "6222020200112233",
  "amount": 13990000,
  "currency": "CNY",
  "region": "CN",
  "province": "CN-GD",
  "bankSplit": { "WEBANK": 70, "CMB": 30 },
  "actor": { "type": "human", "staffId": "CO-17", "role": "credit_officer", "department": "SME Lending Ops",
             "reason": "Manual payout: agent run failed after approval", "approvalRef": "TICKET-4471" }
}

### rejected: ratios add up to 90%  ->  400 invalid_bank_ratio
POST {{base}}/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "U-1", "accountNo": "1", "amount": 1000000, "region": "VN", "province": "VN-HN",
  "bankSplit": { "VCB": 60, "TCB": 30 }, "actor": { "type": "agent", "agentId": "agent-4", "version": "4.2.0" } }

### rejected: more than 2 decimals  ->  400 invalid_bank_ratio
POST {{base}}/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "U-1", "accountNo": "1", "amount": 1000000, "region": "VN", "province": "VN-HN",
  "bankSplit": { "VCB": 66.667, "TCB": 33.333 }, "actor": { "type": "agent", "agentId": "agent-4", "version": "4.2.0" } }

### rejected: Agent 3 may not withdraw  ->  403 actor_not_allowed
POST {{base}}/v1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "U-1", "accountNo": "1", "amount": 1000000, "region": "VN", "province": "VN-HN",
  "bankSplit": { "VCB": 100 }, "actor": { "type": "agent", "agentId": "agent-3", "version": "1.0.0" } }

### list withdrawals, newest first
GET {{base}}/v1/withdrawals?limit=20

### one withdrawal (id or transaction hash) — paste an id from the responses above
@wid = WD-ED46743BC5E11650
GET {{base}}/v1/withdrawals/{{wid}}

### verify it against the chain
GET {{base}}/v1/withdrawals/{{wid}}/verify

### decrypt a withdrawal with a key from the overview's Secrets section (bank key: summary + its share; master key: all)
POST {{base}}/explorer/api/decrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{ "withdrawalId": "{{wid}}", "privateKey": "<paste a private key from GET /v1/overview>" }

### a bank registers a new public key (new withdrawals use it; old ones keep the old key)
PUT {{base}}/v1/banks/VCB/public-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publicKey": "<64 hex characters>" }

### ------------------------------------------------------------ audit trail (Agents 1, 2, 3, 5)

### anchor the hash of a document
POST {{base}}/v1/audit/anchors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "APP-2026-0001", "kind": "algorithm_output",
  "content": { "doc": { "grade": "C", "limit": 13990000, "rateBps": 1200, "sweepRateBps": 6300 } },
  "uri": "s3://webank-sg/APP-2026-0001/ticket.json" }

### list the anchors of a subject
GET {{base}}/v1/audit/anchors/APP-2026-0001

### recompute the hash chain
GET {{base}}/v1/audit/anchors/APP-2026-0001/verify

### was this exact document anchored?
POST {{base}}/v1/audit/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": { "doc": { "grade": "C", "limit": 13990000, "rateBps": 1200, "sweepRateBps": 6300 } } }

### ------------------------------------------------------------ explorer (public, no token)

GET {{base}}/explorer/api/overview

###
GET {{base}}/explorer/api/search?q={{wid}}
